60-Day DevOps Interview Crack Roadmap

Since you’re already strong in Terraform & CI/CD, this will sharpen you for mid → senior level.

⸻

🗓️ Phase 1 (Day 1–20): Strong Foundations

✅ Terraform
	•	Modules
	•	Remote backend
	•	Workspaces
	•	State import
	•	Lifecycle rules
	•	Destroy protection

✅ Kubernetes
	•	Pods, Deployments, Services
	•	HPA
	•	Ingress
	•	ConfigMaps & Secrets
	•	Probes
	•	Rolling updates

Goal:

Be able to explain everything without looking at notes.

⸻

🗓️ Phase 2 (Day 21–40): Production Engineering

Build This Project:

Terraform:
	•	Create VPC
	•	Create EKS
	•	Create RDS
	•	Create ALB

Kubernetes:
	•	Deploy app with Helm
	•	Enable HPA
	•	Setup Ingress
	•	Configure secrets

Add:
	•	CI/CD pipeline
	•	GitOps flow

Now you have real interview story.

⸻

🗓️ Phase 3 (Day 41–60): Interview Mastery

Practice:
	•	20 scenario-based questions daily
	•	Whiteboard architecture explanation
	•	Explain:
	•	Multi-region design
	•	Disaster recovery
	•	Cost optimization
	•	Security hardening

Must Be Able To Explain:
	•	How traffic flows from user → ALB → Ingress → Service → Pod
	•	How Terraform state works internally
	•	What happens when node crashes
	•	How autoscaling works

⸻

🎯 Interview Winning Formula

In every answer:

1️⃣ Mention monitoring
2️⃣ Mention rollback
3️⃣ Mention automation
4️⃣ Mention security
5️⃣ Mention prevention

That’s what separates junior from senior.

